{"id":"n-20261030-9hk2fw","category":"gaming","display_title":"Death Stranding Anime Trailer","display_title_he":"טריילר לאנימה של דת' סטראנדינג","short_summary":"Kojima Productions released the first trailer for Death Stranding Isolations, an original anime series heading to Disney+ in 2027.","english_level":"C1","words":446,"reading_time":3,"image":null,"sources":[{"name":"IGN","domain":"ign.com","url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/death-stranding-isolations-anime-gets-first-trailer","title":"Death Stranding Isolations Anime Gets First Trailer","published_at":"2026-10-30T02:51:05.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:51:05.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-30T07:52:17.602Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":9,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Kojima Productions has officially unveiled the initial teaser trailer for Death Stranding Isolations, an upcoming original anime series set within the distinct universe of the acclaimed franchise. According to the announcement shared by the studio via a tweet late on October 29, which coincided with the morning of October 30 in Japan, the animated project is scheduled to premiere exclusively on the Disney+ streaming platform in 2027. Although the exact release date remains unconfirmed, the project has already generated significant excitement among fans of the broader media landscape.","In the newly released promotional footage, viewers witness a young girl with blonde hair being abruptly awakened from her slumber by unsettling dreams of being entirely consumed by the hazardous tar. Accompanying this striking visual, a cryptic and disturbing quote released with the announcement reads, \"My mom became a crater.\" Creators have explicitly noted that the narrative will follow its own unique ensemble of characters, strongly indicating that familiar figures from the original video game, such as Sam Porter Bridges and Fragile, will not serve as the primary focus of the storyline.","The creative team driving this ambitious adaptation boasts an array of notable industry veterans. The series is directed by Takayuki Sano, whose extensive background includes serving as the animation director for the final season of Attack on Titan, alongside contributions to episodes of Jujutsu Kaisen and the movie Jujutsu Kaisen 0. Furthermore, Sano is widely recognized for his versatility in doing key animation, designing creatures and props, and taking on various other crucial production duties for numerous major anime over the years. Meanwhile, the series composition and screenplay are penned by Tow Ubukata, a celebrated science-fiction author known for lending his talents to Psycho-Pass 3, Psycho-Pass: Providence, Ghost in the Shell: The New Movie, and working as the free scenario plotter for Shenmue. Animation duties have been entrusted to E&H production, a studio recognized for their work on Ninja Kamui, the Undead Unluck: Winter Arc, and the 2026 Magic Knight Rayearth reboot.","Beyond this television project, Hideo Kojima also provided a glimpse of other ongoing endeavors. He revealed a fresh poster for his upcoming horror title OD Knock, developed in collaboration with director Jordan Peele, which shows Sophia Lillis looking up at a long, red object above her. This latest update follows the game director's expressed intention to make cameo appearances in films and television, including a role in an upcoming major live-action film. Additionally, news surrounding his studio's next major action espionage game, Physint, highlighted that the project recently changed hands from Sony to Xbox, with Kojima already confirming a cast that includes Bill Skarsgard, Charlie Fraser, and Minami Hamabe, even though broader details regarding the game remain notably sparse."],"facts":[{"fact":"Kojima Productions revealed the first trailer for Death Stranding Isolations, an original anime series set in the world of Death Stranding, scheduled to release on Disney+ in 2027.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The teaser features a blonde girl awakened by dreams of being consumed by tar and includes the quote, 'My mom became a crater.'","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The series will feature a unique ensemble of distinct characters rather than focusing on major game figures like Sam Porter Bridges.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Death Stranding Isolations is directed by Takayuki Sano, written by Tow Ubukata, and animated by E&H production.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Kojima Productions","lemma":"Kojima Productions","pos":"noun","he":"קוג'ימה פרודקשנס","name":"true"},{"text":"officially","lemma":"officially","pos":"adverb","he":"באופן רשמי","name":false},{"text":"unveiled","lemma":"unveil","pos":"verb","he":"חשף","name":false},{"text":"initial","lemma":"initial","pos":"adjective","he":"ראשוני","name":false},{"text":"teaser trailer","lemma":"teaser trailer","pos":"noun","he":"טריילר טיזר","name":false},{"text":"Death Stranding Isolations","lemma":"Death Stranding Isolations","pos":"noun","he":"דית' סטראנדינג איזוליישנס","name":"true"},{"text":"upcoming","lemma":"upcoming","pos":"adjective","he":"הקרוב","name":false},{"text":"original","lemma":"original","pos":"adjective","he":"מקומי / מקורי","name":false},{"text":"anime series","lemma":"anime series","pos":"noun","he":"סדרת אנימה","name":false},{"text":"distinct","lemma":"distinct","pos":"adjective","he":"מובהק / ייחודי","name":false},{"text":"universe","lemma":"universe","pos":"noun","he":"עולם / היקום","name":false},{"text":"acclaimed","lemma":"acclaimed","pos":"adjective","he":"מוערך","name":false},{"text":"franchise","lemma":"franchise","pos":"noun","he":"זיכיון","name":false},{"text":"announcement","lemma":"announcement","pos":"noun","he":"הכרזה","name":false},{"text":"shared","lemma":"share","pos":"verb","he":"שצוין / שותף","name":false},{"text":"studio","lemma":"studio","pos":"noun","he":"סטודיו","name":false},{"text":"tweet","lemma":"tweet","pos":"noun","he":"ציוץ","name":false},{"text":"coincide